PROJECT TITLE
AI FITNESS PLAN

1. INTRODUCTION

AI Fitness Plan is a simple fitness recommendation system that provides personalized workout suggestions based on the user's fitness goal and fitness level.

2. PROJECT OBJECTIVE

The main objective of this project is to provide a suitable fitness plan based on user input and make fitness planning simple and easy to understand.

3. SYSTEM INPUT

The system accepts the following information:

• User name
• Fitness goal
• Fitness level

4. SYSTEM PROCESS

The entered user information is analyzed by the program. Based on the selected fitness goal and intensity level, the system provides suitable workout recommendations.

5. SYSTEM OUTPUT

The system generates:

• A 7-day workout plan
• Recommended exercises
• Workout duration
• Rest and recovery suggestions
• General fitness tips

6. TECHNOLOGIES USED

• Python
• Artificial Intelligence concepts
• GitHub

7. PROJECT RESULT

The project successfully generates a personalized fitness plan based on the user's selected fitness goal and fitness level.

8. CONCLUSION

The AI Fitness Plan project demonstrates how programming and AI concepts can be used to provide personalized fitness recommendations. The system is simple, user-friendly and can be further improved with advanced AI features in the future.
